ot;。\r\n需要你给依据，比如：\r\n&quot;过去 6 个月 TOP100 商品增速中位数 38%，取 1.6 倍≈60% 作为机会线&quot;\r\n\r\n待定的阈值（现在的默认值）：\r\n· 窗口期：环比增速 ≥ 60\r\n· 新品机会：上市 ≤ 90 天 且 增速 ≥ 100 且 销量 ≥ 1000\r\n· 市场机会：同国家×二级类目 ≥ 3 条，中位增速 ≥ 60，正增长占比 ≥ 50\r\n· 增速品类：同类目 ≥ 3 条，平均增速 ≥ 80\r\n· 成分机会：成分出现在 ≥ 3 个商品，中位增速 ≥ 80\r\n\r\n另外请你拍板一件事：\r\n平台自己标了 MARKET_FLOW.韩国 = 'no'（TikTok Shop 韩国站没开通，\r\n只有 Hwahae / Olive Young 的成分口碑名次，拿不到销量）。\r\n我的建议是不要掩饰，主动在答辩里说出来——评委一看就知道我们懂数据边界。\r\n你同意的话，麻烦写一句对外口径。\r\n"},"s1DqH3gr4a7u72k40RuorO":{"page-node-id":"s1DqH3gr4a7u72k40RuorO","type":"text","parentId":"bsI47QdtsOQRiNmEw963Rw","children":null,"content":"\r\n"},"2GSnNelWOb4Uz6OY3KTjiY":{"page-node-id":"2GSnNelWOb4Uz6OY3KTjiY","type":"element","parentId":"bsI47QdtsOQRiNmEw963Rw","tag":"hr","children":[]},"XId9k0YJCPSHdyvbJrbjMJ":{"page-node-id":"XId9k0YJCPSHdyvbJrbjMJ","type":"text","parentId":"bsI47QdtsOQRiNmEw963Rw","children":null,"content":"\r\n"},"JbZ75XFGUGJaKMACsyr36O":{"page-node-id":"JbZ75XFGUGJaKMACsyr36O","type":"element","parentId":"bsI47QdtsOQRiNmEw963Rw","tag":"h2","attributes":{"id":"_3"},"children":["Guhoo2JvxRMPvEtizIDUjB"]},"Guhoo2JvxRMPvEtizIDUjB":{"page-node-id":"Guhoo2JvxRMPvEtizIDUjB","type":"text","parentId":"JbZ75XFGUGJaKMACsyr36O","children":null,"content":"消息四 · 每天的用户三层消息（模板）"},"eJIcnX84cCsYfQWDTy3QB6":{"page-node-id":"eJIcnX84cCsYfQWDTy3QB6","type":"text","parentId":"bsI47QdtsOQRiNmEw963Rw","children":null,"content":"\r\n"},"VgElhvRLtFE6TYZSvUTjMy":{"page-node-id":"VgElhvRLtFE6TYZSvUTjMy","type":"element","parentId":"bsI47QdtsOQRiNmEw963Rw","tag":"pre","children":["qEPBxkG8OONYTfARniMDqT"]},"qEPBxkG8OONYTfARniMDqT":{"page-node-id":"qEPBxkG8OONYTfARniMDqT","type":"element","parentId":"VgElhvRLtFE6TYZSvUTjMy","tag":"code","children":["sp497pwxqdr1WdzMcJ6DnC"]},"sp497pwxqdr1WdzMcJ6DnC":{"page-node-id":"sp497pwxqdr1WdzMcJ6DnC","type":"text","parentId":"qEPBxkG8OONYTfARniMDqT","children":null,"content":"【日更 · [日期]】\r\n今天：\r\n- [做了什么，说结果不说过程]\r\n- [同上]\r\n\r\n明天：\r\n- [逐条列，最多 3 条]\r\n\r\n卡住：\r\n- [具体卡在哪、需要谁给什么] ／